{
  "id": "analytic-approach",
  "term": "analytic approach",
  "definition": "In this biological research context, an analytic approach is a way of examining data that combines speech movement tracking with MEG brain recordings in the same experiment. It is used to derive person-specific speech movement measures and test ideas about what movement-related information is represented and processed in parts of the speech motor system.",
